(x,τ), every F(τ) is strongly measurable by continuity, F(r) integrable by N001, and F′(r) strongly measurable. Smoothness gives the pointwise derivative in τ, and |F′(τ)(x)|≤b(x) for τ∈J. M006 therefore applies and gives E differentiable at r with derivative ∫e_t(x,r)dx. This proves N002 for arbitrary r.\\\",\\\"uses\\\":[\\\"N001\\\",\\\"H003\\\",\\\"M001\\\",\\\"M004\\\",\\\"M005\\\",\\\"M006\\\"],\\\"uses_local\\\":[],\\\"objects\\\":[\\\"r\\\",\\\"e\\\",\\\"E\\\",\\\"u\\\"],\\\"produces\\\":[],\\\"introduces\\\":[],\\\"discharges\\\":[]}],\\\"applications\\\":[{\\\"input\\\":\\\"M006\\\",\\\"at\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"bindings\\\":\\\"α=ℝⁿ,μ=Lebesgue,𝕜=E=ℝ,x₀=r,s=(r/2,3r/2),F(τ)(x)=e(x,τ),F′(τ)(x)=e_t(x,τ),bound=K1_C.\\\",\\\"hypothesis_checks\\\":[\\\"r lies in the open neighborhood interval.\\\",\\\"Each F(τ) is continuous, hence a.e. strongly measurable.\\\",\\\"F(r) integrable by N001.\\\",\\\"F′(r) is continuous and strongly measurable.\\\",\\\"Compactness of C×J and continuity bound e_t on C; it vanishes outside C, yielding domination.\\\",\\\"K1_C is integrable because C has finite Lebesgue measure.\\\",\\\"Smoothness proves the pointwise derivative identity.\\\"]},{\\\"input\\\":\\\"M005\\\",\\\"at\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"bindings\\\":\\\"X=ℝⁿ,Y=ℝ,s=C,t=J.\\\",\\\"hypothesis_checks\\\":[\\\"Both factors are Euclidean topological spaces.\\\",\\\"C compact by H003.\\\",\\\"J is a compact closed bounded interval.\\\"]},{\\\"input\\\":\\\"M004\\\",\\\"at\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"bindings\\\":\\\"α=C×J,β=ℝ,s=C×J,f=e_t.\\\",\\\"hypothesis_checks\\\":[\\\"C×J compact by M005.\\\",\\\"Euclidean spaces have uniform structures.\\\",\\\"e_t continuous by smoothness.\\\"]}]}}]}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report exact status, location, explanation, basis, partial_progress. SUBSTANTIVE_GAP or SUSPECTED_GAP stops for an actual unsupported mathematical implication; give its premises, conclusion and mathematical grounds. SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE or INPUT_CONFLICT stops for a real source-access/original-input obstacle. Ordinary unfinished drafting, source registration or format work must use TASK_INCOMPLETE: this records progress without ending the stage; continue the actual work. Difficulty or artifact incompletion alone is not a mathematical gap.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"obstacle_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["obstacle_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"probe_library","description":"Query a proved Mathlib theorem and its exact signature/axioms in the offline sandbox. Returns located evidence for an M source; the mathematical statement and applicability still require review.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"declaration":{"type":"string"},"module":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","declaration","module"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_draft","description":"Read a JSON pointer in your own same-stage candidate after an actual structural check. No other file/stage is accessible; choose a narrow pointer for large objects.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"candidate":{"type":"integer"},"pointer":{"type":"string"}},"required":["candidate","pointer"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false}],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":false,"prompt_cache_key":"a6008bfa-3e92-4dc5-9292-5bdfee4634b6","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"low"},"top_p":0.98,"top_logprobs":0,"temperature":1.0,"reasoning":{"effort":"high","context":"all_turns","summary":null,"mode":"standard"},"user":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":71097,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":61312,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":772,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":29},"total_tokens":71869,"attribution":{"items":{"fc_0bfe6e1fa8f24ccf016adb3b0a8810819